## 📊 États et Transitions

```
CREATED (off-chain, link generated)
    │
    ▼
PENDING_CLAIM (on-chain, funded)
    │
    ├──[recipient.claim()]──→ CLAIMED ✅
    │
    ├──[sender.cancel()]───→ CANCELLED (refund)
    │
    └──[timeout expired]───→ EXPIRED (refund)
```

